OL,3,A'Too many lives cut short' because test
OL,4,Aand trace not in place early enough, UK
OL,5,ACovid inquiry finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FFailings in testing and tracing left
OL,8,Fthe UK effectively blind to how quickly
OL,9,FCovid was spreading early in the
OL,10,Fpandemic, the UK Covid Inquiry finds
OL,12,F"The UK was simply not prepared. Too
OL,13,Fmany lives were cut short," the
OL,14,Finquiry's chairwoman says - you can
OL,15,Fwatch her remarks live at the top of
OL,16,Fthe page
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
